LGTM

One suggestion: use the exported `UserType` in the README example, so the shape isn't written twice:

```ts
import { UserType } from '@fastify/jwt'

declare module 'fastify' {
  interface FastifyRequest {
    jwtUser: UserType
  }
}
```

Same in `types/decorator-name.tst.ts`, so the test matches the docs.
